        1379,
        1387
      ],
      "start": 911.72,
      "end": 915.48
    },
    {
      "en": "Well, if you don't understand what the artist is trying to communicate, it can seem a little like that.",
      "asr_range": [
        1387,
        1406
      ],
      "start": 916.24,
      "end": 922.4
    },
    {
