        1411,
        1419
      ],
      "start": 925.04,
      "end": 927.92
    },
    {
      "en": "The first was a huge one, which I suppose was a tree, although it could have been anything.",
      "asr_range": [
        1419,
        1437
      ],
      "start": 928.16,
      "end": 933.36
    },
    {
      "en": "What did you like about it?",
