        1443,
        1449
      ],
      "start": 936.31,
      "end": 938.23
    },
    {
      "en": "It was like the tree was made of hard metal, and the mix of white and gray made everything look like it was winter—freezing winter.",
      "asr_range": [
        1449,
        1475
      ],
      "start": 938.47,
      "end": 946.95
    },
    {
